{
  "units": [
    {
      "unit_id": "compact-01",
      "spoken_text": "十八岁拿下第一座巡回赛冠军。锦织圭，把亚洲男子网球带向了更远的地方。",
      "audio": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-01.mp3",
      "marks": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-01-marks.json",
      "audio_in": 0,
      "audio_out": 6.768,
      "duration": 6.768,
      "placement_hint": "intro",
      "author_tts": true,
      "speaker": "documentary_author",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "+22%",
      "text_sha256": "dbccf4ef4b961db1061f3b5509c87c2d8e6cccd532813e8df909485064562f54",
      "human_heard": false
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "compact-02",
      "spoken_text": "东京、孟菲斯、巴塞罗那。从第一座到第十二座，每一次捧杯，都有自己的重量。",
      "audio": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-02.mp3",
      "marks": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-02-marks.json",
      "audio_in": 0,
      "audio_out": 6.888,
      "duration": 6.888,
      "placement_hint": "title_reactions",
      "author_tts": true,
      "speaker": "documentary_author",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "+22%",
      "text_sha256": "7560578cd72a96534796ab6339c0f34790d26038ed2b02b12d63e8bc90085e23",
      "human_heard": false
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "compact-03",
      "spoken_text": "费德勒、纳达尔、德约科维奇，他都赢过。美网击败德约，让他走进大满贯决赛。",
      "audio": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-03.mp3",
      "marks": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-03-marks.json",
      "audio_in": 0,
      "audio_out": 6.84,
      "duration": 6.84,
      "placement_hint": "big_three_and_us2014",
      "author_tts": true,
      "speaker": "documentary_author",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "+22%",
      "text_sha256": "5b35042cb200bfac4bd87954181e6ecd085f28ecb6264aeb1737976d1782d604",
      "human_heard": false
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "compact-04",
      "spoken_text": "决赛没能夺冠，但他成为了首位晋级大满贯男单决赛的亚洲球员。",
      "audio": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-04.mp3",
      "marks": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-04-marks.json",
      "audio_in": 0,
      "audio_out": 5.448,
      "duration": 5.448,
      "placement_hint": "us2014_final",
      "author_tts": true,
      "speaker": "documentary_author",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "+22%",
      "text_sha256": "5de0a94dd1ca4f26df8bcf1dd8dc4694a6e14dce9bce54b496bec155b65cd335",
      "human_heard": false
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "compact-05",
      "spoken_text": "里约拿下铜牌。同年回到纽约，他再进四强。那些漫长的第五盘，他从不轻易交出去。",
      "audio": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-05.mp3",
      "marks": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-05-marks.json",
      "audio_in": 0,
      "audio_out": 7.872,
      "duration": 7.872,
      "placement_hint": "rio_and_murray",
      "author_tts": true,
      "speaker": "documentary_author",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "+22%",
      "text_sha256": "55a601f929514ff78b031b36cc2eee4c121361da4a4ed890090184a002bf2cb0",
      "human_heard": false
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "compact-06",
      "spoken_text": "伤病让他停下，也让归来变得更难。可他还是回到年终舞台，再次击败费德勒。",
      "audio": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-06.mp3",
      "marks": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-06-marks.json",
      "audio_in": 0,
      "audio_out": 6.528,
      "duration": 6.528,
      "placement_hint": "finals2018",
      "author_tts": true,
      "speaker": "documentary_author",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "+22%",
      "text_sha256": "7310fb3a4743269e902b0257f23bf56619d5231a93ea748b34986437ce3b758b",
      "human_heard": false
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "compact-07",
      "spoken_text": "十二冠的最后一座在布里斯班。伤病让他走了很多弯路，却没让他放弃回到球场。",
      "audio": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-07.mp3",
      "marks": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-07-marks.json",
      "audio_in": 0,
      "audio_out": 6.696,
      "duration": 6.696,
      "placement_hint": "brisbane_and_ao2025",
      "author_tts": true,
      "speaker": "documentary_author",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "+22%",
      "text_sha256": "f21d0b8927099e53e82192089ab4ce921624895d05ccd0083a92afb71da360db",
      "human_heard": false
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "compact-08",
      "spoken_text": "2026年10月1日，东京。最后一场巡回赛结束，把最后的话留给他自己。",
      "audio": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-08.mp3",
      "marks": "/workspace/tennislive-work/work/nishikori-career-farewell/compact-publication/audio/compact-08-marks.json",
